# A terminal pane: a double-click selects the word under the pointer and
# a triple the whole line, and with `ui.copy_on_select` (on by default)
# the selection is copied as a drag's is — Ctrl+Shift+V pastes it back
# into the child, which echoes it. The child's first line is row 21 of
# the split at 120x40, its text from column 1.
write a.txt "x\n"
open a.txt
command view.toggle_tree
ex term sh -c "printf 'alpha SELECTME omega\n'; exec cat"
wait 500
expect screen contains "alpha SELECTME omega"
doubleclick 9 21
key ctrl+shift+v
expect within 3000 screen contains "▌SELECTME "
click 3 21
doubleclick 3 21
key ctrl+shift+v
expect within 3000 screen contains "▌SELECTMEalpha SELECTME omega"
